      "updated": 1794000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The form doesn't use HospitalField yet: searching a hospital there is planned. A caregiver sees the patient's appointment read-only\nwhen the patient shares Planning (ObserveCareSection); adding, editing and deleting for the patient come with US-41 and #341.\nThe summary only reports what the patient logged, and the patient chooses what goes in it.",
      "originalText": "The form doesn't use HospitalField yet: searching a hospital there is planned. A caregiver sees the patient's appointment read-only\nwhen the patient shares Planning (ObserveCareSection); adding, editing and deleting for the patient come with US-41 and #341.\nThe summary only reports what the patient logged, and the patient chooses what goes in it.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
